        "original_id": "27affa66-0b99-503c-9274-5ce83c7b013a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Flexible-fuel vehicles, bi-fuel vehicles, hydrogen vehicles\n- Concepts: Fuel storage systems, onboard fuel use, motive power, CNG, LPG, hydrogen\n\nFacts:\n- Flexible-fuel vehicles are distinguished from bi-fuel vehicles.\n- Bi-fuel vehicles store two fuels in separate tanks and run the engine on one fuel at a time.\n- Compressed natural gas, liquefied petroleum gas, and hydrogen are examples of fuels used in bi-fuel vehicles.\n- A hydrogen vehicle is a vehicle that uses hydrogen as its onboard fuel for motive power.",
